#  SYNTHETIC TEST FIXTURE - NOT A CREDENTIAL - SAFE TO PUBLISH
# ============================================================================
#  This RSA-3072 private key exists so that tests/vectors/confidential_container
#  .json is byte-stable across regenerations. It is generated once by
#  scripts/make_container_vector.py and reused, because RSA-OAEP is randomised
#  and a fresh pair each run would make every regeneration look like a change.
#
#  It protects nothing. It is not copied into the Docker image (see Dockerfile),
#  is not imported by handler.py, artifacts.py, worker.js or the browser client,
#  and the same key material is already published in the vector JSON as
#  v2.private_key_pkcs8_b64 so the JavaScript tests can use it.
#
#  NEVER use this key for anything real. If you need one, generate your own.
# ============================================================================
